msgid "Boot menu wait time"
msgstr "Waktu tunggu menu boot"

#: src/anduinos_control_panel/app.py:661
msgid "The same delay is used after an interrupted or unsuccessful startup."
msgstr "Jeda yang sama digunakan setelah startup terganggu atau gagal."

